oshi later returns to the bar seeking information about BAHATI, where he uncovers a connection to a language school destroyed in a devastating fire ten years earlier.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oND1N936VhQSIxxyVKwMc3sStBl.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19078","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170166","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56752","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"123542","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402033","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"87987","synopsis":"After witnessing the academy fire, Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang search for anyone who survived the disaster. Their investigation leads Cheng into a photograph belonging to Wang Qing, a gifted student trapped in a difficult situation, where he uncovers a personal connection that may bring him closer to the truth about his father.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7h5tBm4MfcPLFyJjowuQHD7GnIY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19078","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170166","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56752","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"123542","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402033","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"90199","synopsis":"To earn Vein’s help in locating Wang Qing, Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang agree to replace a missing model at a photo shoot. Their unusual payment leads them to Wang Qing’s mental health clinic, where her psychological tests begin raising unsettling questions about the people and hidden motives surrounding their investigation.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300